@startuml

title DailyCo — Sequence Diagram: Customer Design & Order Flow

actor Customer as C
participant "Browser\n(Alpine.js)" as BR
participant "DesignController" as DC
participant "Storage" as ST
participant "DB (desains)" as DBD
participant "DB (carts)" as DBC
participant "CheckoutController" as CC
participant "DB (orders)" as DBO
participant "DB (order_details)" as DBOD

== Proses Desain ==

C -> BR : Pilih produk, klik "Mulai Desain"
BR -> DC : GET /customer/design/{produk}?color=
DC -> BR : Return editor.blade.php\n(dengan $produk, $templates, $totalSteps)

C -> BR : (Editor Terbuka)\nStep 1: Pilih warna baju
note right of BR: Alpine baseColor diupdate\nCSS multiply blend mockup

C -> BR : Step 2-5: Desain di canvas\n(Fabric.js)
note right of BR: Objek ditambah, dimodif,\nundo/redo, zoom/pan

C -> BR : Step Review: Preview OK\nKlik "Simpan & Masukkan ke Keranjang"

BR -> BR : Export canvas ke dataURL PNG\n(multiplier: 4)\nPackage canvas JSON + payload
BR -> DC : POST /customer/design (JSON)

DC -> ST : Decode base64 → simpan PNG\n(designs/{uuid}.png)
DC -> DBD : Desain::create({...})
DC -> DBC : Cart::create({id_desain=new, qty=1})
DC -> BR : JSON {success: true, redirect_url: /customer/cart}
BR -> C : Redirect ke /customer/cart

== Proses Checkout ==

C -> BR : Centang item, klik "Checkout"
BR -> CC : GET /customer/checkout?cart_ids[]=...
CC -> DBC : Load cart items
CC -> BR : Return checkout confirmation view

C -> BR : Konfirmasi, klik "Buat Pesanan"
BR -> CC : POST /customer/checkout {cart_ids}

CC -> CC : DB::transaction {
CC -> DBO : Order::create({status_order='reviewing', payment_status='unpaid'})
CC -> DBOD : OrderDetail::create (per cart item)
note right of CC: id_desain dari cart\nstatus_desain='pending' (ada desain)\natau 'approved' (ready-made)
CC -> DBC : Cart::whereIn(ids)->delete()
CC -> CC : }

CC -> BR : Redirect /customer/orders (flash success)
BR -> C : Tampil halaman pesanan

@enduml
